@tablet 
@obverse 
1. _1(disz) sag-geme2_ i3-li2-bi#?-ti#? _mu-ni_ 
#tr.ts: ištēt amtam ilībītī šumša
#tr.en: One slave girl, her name is Ilībītī,

2. qa2-du _dumu gaba_-sza 
#tr.ts: adi mār irtīša
#tr.en: together with her suckling son,

3. _sza3_ ma-at bi-ri-tim 
# CAD B p. 253a 
#tr.ts: libbum māt birītim
#tr.en: from the region between (the rivers),

4. _sag-geme2_ {d}amar-utu-mu-sza-lim _dumu_ ip-qu2-{d}na-bi-um 
#tr.ts: amat marduk-muša(l)lim mār ipqu-nabium
#tr.en: the slave of Marduk-mušallim son of ipqu-nabûm,

5. _ki_ {d}amar-utu-mu-sza-lim _dumu_ ip-qu2-{d}na-bi-um 
#tr.ts: itti marduk-muša(l)lim mār ipqu-nabium
#tr.en: from Marduk-mušallim son of Ipqu-nabûm,

6. be-el _sag-geme2_ 
#tr.ts: bēl amtim
#tr.en: the owner of the slave,

7. {disz}be-el-szu-nu _a-zu!_ 
#tr.ts: bēlšunu asûm
#tr.en: Bēlšūnu the physician

8. _dumu_ {d}suen-sze-me-e 
#tr.ts: mār sîn-šēmi
#tr.en: son of Sîn-šēmi

9. _in-szi-in-sa10_ 
#tr.ts: išām
#tr.en: has bought.

10. _sa10 til-la-bi-sze3_ 
#tr.ts: ana šīmīša gamrim
#tr.en: As her full price,

11. _1(disz) 1/3(disz) ma-na 4(disz) gin2# ku3#-babbar_ 
#tr.ts: ištēn u šaluš manā erbet šiqil kaspam
#tr.en: 84 shekels of silver

12. _in-na-an-la2_ 
#tr.ts: išqul
#tr.en: he has paid

13. u3 _1(disz) gin2 ku3-babbar si-bi_ isz-ku-un 
#tr.ts: u ištēn šiqil kašpam atrīša iškun
#tr.en: and has established 1 shekel of silver as her additional payment.

14. a-na _u4 3(disz)-kam_ te-eb-i-tum 
#tr.ts: ana šalāšat ūmī teb’ītum
#tr.en: For 3 days of inspection,

15. a-na _iti 1(disz)-kam_ be2-en-nu 
#tr.ts: ana ištēn warḫim bennu(m)
#tr.en: for one month for (the slave’s contracting) epilepsy

16. [a-na] ba-aq-ri-sza 
#tr.ts: ana baqrīša
#tr.en: (and) for any claims about her

17. sza ib-ba-asz-szu-u2 
#tr.ts: ša ibbaššu
#tr.en: which might be raised,

@reverse 
1. ki-ma s,i-im-da-at _lugal_ iz-za-az 
#tr.ts: kīma ṣimdat šarrim izzaz
#tr.en: (the seller) is responsible in accordance with the royal decree.

$ single ruling 
2. _igi_ {d}suen-isz-me-a-ni _di-ku5_ 
#tr.ts: maḫar sîn-išmea(n)ni dayyānim
#tr.en: Before Sîn-išmeanni, judge,

3. _dumu_ {d}suen-im-gur-an-ni 
#tr.ts: mār sîn-imguranni
#tr.en: son of Sîn-imguranni;

4. _igi_ ta-ri-ba-tum _dumu_ {d}utu-mu-ba-li2-it, 
#tr.ts: maḫar tarībatum mār šamaš-muba(l)liṭ
#tr.en: before Tarībatum son of Šamaš-muballiṭ;

5. _igi_ i3-li2-eri-ba-am _dumu_ wa-ak-ka 
#tr.ts: maḫar ilī-erībam mār wakka
#tr.en: before Ilī-erībam son of Wakka;

6. _igi_ ib-na-tum _dumu_ i-din-{d}en-lil2 
#tr.ts: maḫar ibnatum mār i(d)din-enlil
#tr.en: before Ibnatum son of Iddin-enlil;

7. _igi_ ib-ni-{d}iszkur _dumu_ gi-mil-{d}amar-utu 
#tr.ts: maḫar ibni-adad mār gimil-marduk
#tr.en: before Ibni-adad son of Gimil-marduk;

8. _igi_ {d}suen-im-gur-an-ni _dub-sar_ 
#tr.ts: maḫar sîn-imguranni ṭupšarrim
#tr.en: before Sîn-imguranni the scribe.

$ blank space 
9. _iti bara2-za3-gar 2(disz)-kam-ma u4 6(disz)-kam_ 
#tr.ts: waraḫ nišānim-šanîm ūmam šeššet
#tr.en: The intercalary month of Nišānum (lit. second Nišānum), the day 6,

10. _mu_ a-bi-e-szu-uh _lugal-e bad3_ a-bi-e-szu-uh _lugal-e ugu gesz#-gi4#-gi4# i7# idigna#{ki#?}-a#_ 
